{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123239","id":4453735068,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCXaanA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123239","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123239.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123239.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123239","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123239/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123239/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123239/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ec48b4a8cdeb4280d0e7bcaaf73f676044cd7118","number":123239,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[3.x] Android: Fix make_dir_recursive returning an error if directory exists","user":{"login":"icarito","id":199755,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTc1NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199755?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito","html_url":"https://github.com/icarito","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icarito/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`DirAccessJAndroid::make_dir_recursive()` returned `ERR_ALREADY_EXISTS` when the target directory already exists, while the generic `DirAccess::make_dir_recursive()` tolerates `ERR_ALREADY_EXISTS` for each component and returns OK. This breaks the idempotency contract that callers rely on.\n\nOne notable victim is `ShaderCacheGLES3` (the GLES3 binary shader cache, enabled with `rendering/gles3/shaders/shader_compilation_mode = \"Asynchronous + Cache\"`). Its constructor calls `make_dir_recursive()` and disables itself on error:\n\n- On the **first** run, the cache directory (`<cache>/godot/shaders`) does not exist, so it gets created (the Java handler uses `File.mkdirs()`), the cache is enabled, and program binaries are written.\n- On every **subsequent** run, the existing directory makes the constructor fail with `Couldn't create shader cache directory. Shader cache disabled.`, so the cache is never read again and all programs are recompiled from source on every cold session.\n\nOn an Adreno 618 device this meant ~40 seconds of synchronous shader compilation at the first rendered frame of a large level on **every** app start, even though the cache had been populated by the previous run. With this fix the cache is loaded as intended and the same scene load drops to ~13 seconds (the remaining cost being program binary loads and variants not yet cached).\n\n**Testing**\n\n- Built the Android templates from this branch and verified on a Redmi Note 9 Pro (Adreno 618, Android 14) that:\n  - The boot log shows `Shader cache: ON` without the `Couldn't create shader cache directory` error on runs after the first one.\n  - Program binaries from the previous session are loaded, removing the full first-frame shader compilation.\n- Also validated the same one-line change against a 3.6.2-stable checkout in production use.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-06T00:28:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T15:04:47Z","closed_at":"2026-09-07T20:57:52Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e1659d03025901b80f47a76872dde1801fc7701e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"i